<title>POLAND: KPBP BICK MARCH NET RISES TO PLN 0.3 MLN.</title>
<headline>KPBP BICK MARCH NET RISES TO PLN 0.3 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-04-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results March </p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>MARCH</p>
<p> Net profit	     0.28 vs   0.17</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 0.31 vs   0.22</p>
<p> Operating loss	 0.04 vs   0.19</p>
<p> Sales		    6.84 vs   4.84</p>
<p>JANUARY-MARCH</p>
<p> Net profit	     0.46 vs   0.37</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 0.61 vs   0.70</p>
<p> Operating profit     0.17 vs   0.49</p>
<p> Sales		   16.94 vs  14.36</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish construction company is</p>
<p>Przedsiebiorstwo Budownictw Przemyslowego KPBP Bick SA.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
